  "text": "WULN – Wayamba University Library Network Skip to content WUSL WUSL Repository askwuln@wyb.ac.lk Facebook page opens in new window YouTube page opens in new window Monday – Friday 8 AM – 6:30 PM WULN Wayamba University Library Network Home About Us About Us Librarian’s Message Our Services Inter Library Loan Borrowing facilities Library catalogue Library Orientation Photocopying Facilities Printout Facilities Document Supply Service (DSS) Research Support Service Webinar Series User Assistance General Rules OPAC User Guide Feedback Ask a Librarian Publications Resources Resources Downloads Staff Staff Contact LQAC WUiR Search: Search Home About Us About Us Librarian’s Message Our Services Inter Library Loan Borrowing facilities Library catalogue Library Orientation Photocopying Facilities Printout Facilities Document Supply Service (DSS) Research Support Service Webinar Series User Assistance General Rules OPAC User Guide Feedback Ask a Librarian Publications Resources Resources Downloads Staff Staff Contact LQAC WUiR wayamba university\nlibrary network KULIYAPITIYA - MAKANDURA - LABUYAYA New Library Complex wayamba university\nlibrary network KULIYAPITIYA - MAKANDURA - LABUYAYA wayamba university\nlibrary network KULIYAPITIYA - MAKANDURA - LABUYAYA Faculty Library - Makandura wayamba university\nlibrary network KULIYAPITIYA - MAKANDURA - LABUYAYA wayamba university\nlibrary network KULIYAPITIYA - MAKANDURA - LABUYAYA OPAC WUIR PAST PAPERS RESEARCH SUPPORT DSS WEBINAR Welcome to the WULN Main Library - Kuliyapitiya Faculty Library - Makandura Medical Library - Labuyaya Main Library - Kuliyapitiya Main Library - Kuliyapitiya Main Library - Kuliyapitiya Main Library - Kuliyapitiya Main Library - Kuliyapitiya About Us The Wayamba University of Sri Lanka started in 1999 as the 13 th university of the country. The library of the university started in the same year as a university library. The Library system of the Wayamba University of Sri Lanka consists of three Libraries; one is at Kuliyapitiya and the other two is at Makandura and Labuyaya. They have been started shearing their services in the e-environment since 2005. READ MORE Keyword Title Author Subject ISBN Series Call Number GENERAL RULES Borrowing facilities OPAC USER GUIDE DOWNLOADS PRINTING SERVICES DOCUMENT SCAN Latest News Have a question? Need assistance? The Librarian from Wayamba University Library Network (WULN) is here to help you. Find Research articles, abstracts and related material Wayamba University Institutional Repository “Discover key library resources and research tips in our webinar series. Perfect for students and researchers looking to make the most of our digital tools and services.” Free e-Resources Academic Databases Library Updated statistics 0 Books 0 Users 0 Library Staff 0 Digital Resources Contact Information Main Library (kuliyapitiya Premises) Wayamba University of Sri Lanka, Lionel Jayathilaka Mawatha, Kuliyapitiya , Sri Lanka. TP -(094) 372018569 Fax-(094) 372283169 Email- librarian@wyb.ac.lk Location Other Links Wayamba University UGC Other University Libraries Designed, Developed and Maintaining by MAIN LIBRARY - Wayamba University of Sri Lanka. - 2026 - Go to Top",
